  "body": "## Install\n\n- **Windows 10/11**: run `ENiShare-Setup-1.1.1.exe`. The installer is not code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may show *Windows protected your PC*; click *More info → Run anyway*.\n- **Ubuntu 22.04+**: `sudo apt install ./enishare_1.1.1_amd64.deb`, or run `ENiShare-1.1.1-x86_64.AppImage`.\n\n## What's new\n\n- Updates are checked against the public EN releases list (github.com/mestiaque/en-releases): no more \"Could not check for updates\" when GitHub's hourly request limit is used up, and updates keep working for apps whose source is private.\n",
